「雖慚柳季之道，豈因訟以受服。」自此免黜久之，終無恨意。中書郎範縝與子野未遇，聞其行業而善焉。會遷國子博士，乃上表讓之，有司以資歷非次，不為通。","source_position":{"start":10378,"end":10505,"raw":"久之兼廷尉正，時三官通署獄，子野嘗不在，同僚輒署其名。奏有不允，子野從坐免職。或勸言請有司，可無咎，子野笑曰：「雖慚柳季之道，豈因訟以受服。」自此免黜久之，終無恨意。中書郎範縝與子野未遇，聞其行業而善焉。會遷國子博士，乃上表讓之，有司以資歷非次，不為通。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"柳季","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"引文不足唯一定位：保留未決候選，不配新人物。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"範縝","kind":"person","person_id":"fwc_fzf_pjh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"中書郎範縝未遇子野而聞行欲讓國子博士，梁030范縝同官同讓官事；範字不改。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0095","start":95,"end":96